WEBVTT

A1
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.400 line:76%
Guide: Select Security in Settings.

B1
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000 line:76%
User: Can I discard the old codes now?

A2
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:16.600 line:76%
Guide: No. Do not discard them before saving the new recovery codes.

SFX
00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:20.820 line:76%
[Two warning sounds indicating a failed security check]

A3
00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:24.460 line:76%
Guide: Complete the security check again, then confirm issuance.

A4
00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:31.700 line:76%
Guide: Save the new codes in a safe place. Once new codes are issued, the old codes can no longer be used.

A5
00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:34.580 line:76%
Guide: Check the issuance complete screen.
